        199.98683166503906,
        368.01708984375,
        209.74879455566406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[NGF] + [TrkA:NGF] = [NGF]0",
      "bbox": [
        229.6290283203125,
        214.93080139160156,
        366.8130798339844,
        224.69276428222656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[Erk] + [pErk] = [Erk]0.",
      "bbox": [
        261.56500244140625,
        229.87477111816406,
        364.22357177734375,
        239.63673400878906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "3.1.2",
      "bbox": [
        48.18896484375,
        259.2087707519531,
        71.7305908203125,
        268.0555419921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reaction rate equation and parametrization",
      "bbox": [
        83.18758392333984,
        259.2087707519531,
        303.71966552734375,
        268.0555419921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under the assumption that the total NGF concentration is much larger than the total TrkA concentration, [NGF]0 ≫",
      "bbox": [
        48.18896484375,
        281.0248718261719,
        547.0865478515625,
        291.924560546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[TrkA]0, the dynamics of TrkA:NGF and pErk can be stated as",
      "bbox": [
        48.18896484375,
        293.5387878417969,
        325.60247802734375,
        303.29974365234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "d[TrkA:NGF]",
      "bbox": [
        151.4879608154297,
        313.9178161621094,
        209.7846221923828,
        322.76458740234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dt",
      "bbox": [
        176.23599243164062,
        327.4909973144531,
        185.02301025390625,
        336.3377685546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "= k1[NGF]0([TrkA]0 −[TrkA:NGF]) −k2[TrkA:NGF]",
      "bbox": [
        213.72898864746094,
        320.0990905761719,
        446.6606140136719,
        330.998779296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "d[pErk]",
      "bbox": [
        177.57101440429688,
        338.9480285644531,
        209.78555297851562,
        347.7947998046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dt",
      "bbox": [
        189.27699279785156,
        352.52197265625,
        198.0640106201172,
        361.3687438964844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "= (k3[TrkA:NGF] + k4)([Erk]0 −[pErk]) −k5[pErk]",
      "bbox": [
        213.72898864746094,
        345.1300354003906,
        438.3155517578125,
        356.02972412109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "y = s[pErk],",
      "bbox": [
        205.7200164794922,
        364.8759460449219,
        258.6946105957031,
        373.72271728515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "with kinetic parameters k = (k1, k2, k3, k4, k5, [TrkA]0, [Erk]0, s). As the absolute concentrations of TrkA and Erk",
      "bbox": [
        48.18902587890625,
        386.3509521484375,
        547.1124877929688,
        396.11187744140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "are unknown, this system is structurally non-identiﬁable. To circumvent this we reformulate the system in terms",
      "bbox": [
        48.18902587890625,
        398.3059387207031,
        547.1160888671875,
        407.1527099609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of x1 = [TrkA:NGF]/k3 and x2 = s[pErk], yielding the ODE model",
      "bbox": [
        48.18902587890625,
        410.26092529296875,
        340.9277648925781,
        420.6026916503906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dx1",
      "bbox": [
        211.0540313720703,
        430.0869140625,
        225.9091033935547,
        439.84783935546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dt = k1[NGF]0(k3[TrkA]0 −x1) −k2x1",
      "bbox": [
        214.33700561523438,
        436.26904296875,
        386.5831298828125,
        452.5067443847656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dx2",
      "bbox": [
        211.05506896972656,
        454.56396484375,
        225.9091339111328,
        464.32489013671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dt = (x1 + k4)(s[Erk]0 −x2) −k5x2",
      "bbox": [
        214.33700561523438,
        460.74603271484375,
        372.8311462402344,
        476.9847412109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "y = x2.",
      "bbox": [
        222.35708618164062,
        480.4909362792969,
        253.814697265625,
        490.25286865234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This ODE model merely depends on the products s[Erk]0 and k3[TrkA]0 and not on the individual parame-",
      "bbox": [
        48.1890869140625,
        501.9659423828125,
        547.1316528320312,
        512.3077392578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ters (s, [Erk]0) and (k3, [TrkA]0), respectively.",
      "bbox": [
        48.18914794921875,
        513.921875,
        253.18919372558594,
        523.682861328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Thus, we obtain the reduced vector of kinetic parameters k =",
      "bbox": [
        261.9861755371094,
        513.921875,
        547.0890502929688,
        522.7686767578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(k1, k2, k4, k5, k3[TrkA]0, s[Erk]0).",
      "bbox": [
        48.18914794921875,
        525.8768920898438,
        192.7432098388672,
        535.6378173828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As initial condition we use the steady state of this system for [NGF]0 = 0,",
      "bbox": [
        48.18914794921875,
        541.81689453125,
        372.092529296875,
        552.15771484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "x1(0) = 0",
      "bbox": [
        253.7911376953125,
        563.0928955078125,
        294.9577331542969,
        572.8538818359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "x2(0) = k4(s[Erk]0)",
      "bbox": [
        253.7911376953125,
        578.1358642578125,
        339.1836242675781,
        594.6378784179688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "k4 + k5",
      "bbox": [
        299.4280090332031,
        591.7099609375,
        330.4231262207031,
        602.05078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": ".",
      "bbox": [
        340.3780517578125,
        584.8759765625,
        343.14764404296875,
        593.7227783203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "3.1.3",
      "bbox": [
        48.189056396484375,
        618.9519653320312,
        71.73068237304688,
        627.7987670898438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Parameter estimation",
      "bbox": [
        83.18767547607422,
        618.9519653320312,
        191.8497772216797,
        627.7987670898438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For the parameter estimation and model selection we constrained the kinetic parameter ki to the interval [10−10, 1010].",
      "bbox": [
        48.189056396484375,
        639.3946533203125,
        549.3782348632812,
        651.666748046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The subpopulation sizes wi have been constrained to [0, 1]. Standard deviations of normal distributions and shape",
      "bbox": [
        48.189056396484375,
        653.2809448242188,
        547.1505126953125,
        663.6227416992188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "parameters of log-normal distributions were constrained to [10−1, 102] and [10−1, 101], respectively.",
      "bbox": [
        48.1890869140625,
        663.3046875,
        479.4361267089844,
        674.082763671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Maximum likelihood estimates and proﬁle likelihood derived conﬁdence intervals are provided in Table 2-4. For the",
      "bbox": [
        48.18914794921875,
        681.1769409179688,
        547.156005859375,
        690.0237426757812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "best two models, MH3,2 and MH3,3, proﬁle likelihoods and their local approximations are depicted in Supplement",
      "bbox": [
        48.18914794921875,
        692.5740966796875,
        547.1600952148438,
        703.4727783203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Figures 1 and 2.",
      "bbox": [
        48.18916320800781,
        705.0869750976562,
        118.99335479736328,
        713.9337768554688
      ],
      "direction": [
